---

## Pages

| Route | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| `/` | Homepage |
| `/barandmenu` | Bar & Menu catalogue |
| `/happenings` | Events & happenings |
| `/contact` | Contact form |
| `/buynow` | Purchase flow |
| `/payment` | Payment page |
| `/success` | Order success |
| `/admin` | Admin dashboard |
| `/admin/products` | Product management |

---

## Deployment

This project is deployed on **Vercel** using a custom `vercel.json` config to route all requests through `server.js`.

Environment variables are configured in the Vercel dashboard under Project Settings → Environment Variables.

